---
title: How to Upload File in Project?
sidebar:
  order: 5
---
**Uploading files in a project allows you to keep all important documents, resources, and references in one place. This makes collaboration easier and ensures your team has quick access to everything they need.**

### **How to upload a file?**

1. **Go to the Main Menu and select Projects.**

1. **To upload a file in a new project:**

   - **Click Create Project.**
   - **Fill in the required details.**

   **Or, to upload a file in an existing project:**

   - **Select the project.**
   - **Click on the three-dot menu on the right.**
   - **Click Edit Project.**

1. **Scroll down to the Project Description section.**

1. **Click on the Attachment icon.**

**5. You will see two options:**

- **Insert URL**
- **Upload File**

**6. Select your preferred option and upload the file.**

**7. Click Save Changes.**

1. 

**Your file will be successfully uploaded to the project.**

**Note: You can control file access by adjusting the Project Visibility (Public/Private).**
